  "kv12.1:7.1": "Na vattabbaṃ ",
  "kv12.1:7.2": "\"Saṃvaro asaṃvaro pi kamman ti\"? ",
  "kv12.1:7.3": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv12.1:7.4": "Nanu vuttaṃ Bhagavatā -- ",
  "kv12.1:7.5": "\"Idha Bhikkhave bhikkhu cakkhunā rūpaṃ disvā nimittaggāhī hoti --pe-- ",
  "kv12.1:7.6": "na nimittaggāhī hoti, sotena saddaṃ sutvā --pe-- ",
  "kv12.1:7.7": "manasā dhammaṃ viññāya nimittaggāhī hoti --pe-- ",
  "kv12.1:7.8": "na nimittaggāhī hotīti.\" ",
  "kv12.1:7.9": "Atth' eva suttanto ti? ",
  "kv12.1:7.10": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv12.1:7.11": "Tena hi ",
  "kv12.1:7.12": "saṃvaro asaṃvaro pi kamman ti. Saṃvaro kamman ti kathā. 1. "
